{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Sosh theme is the theme dedicated to the Sosh brand only."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemessosh"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"code":["🧬 Theme version: 2.7.0"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the Sosh theme any Sosh product must use, and cannot be subclassed.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It embeds also in its target the Sosh brand colors which are not shared nor exposed in lower level targets or outside any module not depending to it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In other words, this ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesSosh\/documentation\/OUDSThemesSosh\/SoshTheme","isActive":true},{"text":" is based on the abstract ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":", uses all the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Unified Design System"}]},{"text":" kit and brings the Sosh brand colors and assets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"tip","type":"aside","name":"Tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This theme embeds and registers the fonts for the Sosh theme, you just need to use the theme object as is."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"important","type":"aside","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Sosh theme does not embed colors for charts yet and is read only: it cannot be subclassed or derivated","type":"text"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"How to use the theme","anchor":"How-to-use-the-theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text